{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115593","id":3224739108,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ANZ0k","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115593","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115593.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115593.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115593","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115593/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115593/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115593/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/79fc93b902c3d4b9c32c7139842be72f2c1aee75","number":115593,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add ray and segment intersection methods to MeshInstance3D","user":{"login":"JamesK89","id":1236880,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzY4ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1236880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesK89","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesK89/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently Godot does not expose the intersect_ray and intersect_segment methods in MeshInstance3D's underlying mesh object.\r\nThis PR implements that functionality and the demo project is available [here](https://github.com/JamesK89/godot-mesh-intersect-test).\r\n\r\nThis is a serious limitation that does not exist in other game engines. Uses cases are things such as accurately placing decals and determining material specific sounds or effects.\r\n\r\nI imagine in real-world use, because this could be potentially expensive, that a developer would perform a physics based raycast and then perform this operation on associated mesh instances in however way they see fit.\r\n\r\nConstructive feedback by those more familiar with the code base are more than welcome.\r\n\r\nPotentially resolves godotengine/godot-proposals#3909 and godotengine/godot-proposals#2863\r\n\r\nFor more background information, see also:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/alexjhetherington/godot-identifying-materials-examples\r\n- http://www.footnotesforthefuture.com/words/godot-identifying-materials/\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-29T19:09:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T16:12:17Z","closed_at":"2026-08-22T14:38:02Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"76c784986c1a6cb52f1d43fa3cd9ddf638c347d2","assign